{"job": "minimal", "start": "hello",
 "note": "最小步驟表：一步 run（有限、冪等、宣告產物），成功走 done。整份放到 <node>/jobs/minimal/",
 "steps": {
  "hello": {"run": ["sh", "-c", "mkdir -p \"$1\" && echo hello > \"$1/hello.txt\"", "sh", "${out}"],
            "finite": true, "idempotent": true, "expect": ["${out}/hello.txt"], "ok": "done", "fail": "failed"},
  "done": {"end": "ok"},
  "failed": {"end": "failed"}}}
